  "description": {
    "en": "Cabinet Mode (内阁模式) for DeepSeek Harness: a declarative dual-identity Lead/teammate agent preset for a Ming-dynasty cabinet team.",
    "zh": "DeepSeek Harness 的内阁模式：声明式双身份首辅/阁臣 agent preset，复刻大明科研司内阁分工。"
  },
